OL,3,GNEWSAMan on CCTV sought after indecent
OL,4,Aexposures on trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice want to speak to a man seen in
OL,7,FCCTV footage after several women
OL,8,Freported indecent exposures onboard
OL,9,Ftrains in Somerset.
OL,11,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said a
OL,12,Fman exposed himself to two women in
OL,13,Fseparate incidents on 13 June on
OL,14,Fservices running in and out of Bath.
OL,16,FA man also exposed himself to a woman
OL,17,Fsitting opposite him on a train between
OL,18,FBath and Trowbridge, Wiltshire, on 7
OL,19,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
