OL,3,GNEWSAMan on CCTV sought after indecent
OL,4,Aexposures on trains
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers have released two CCTV images
OL,7,Fof a man they wish to speak to in
OL,8,Fconnection with the reports, with
OL,9,Fanyone who recognises him asked to
OL,10,Fcontact BTP.
